  "note": "Single binding between every file under config/ and the JSON Schema that governs it. scripts/validate-config.mjs reads this file, refuses unlisted configs, and validates each document with Ajv. Add an entry in the same change that adds a config file; never edit this file to silence a validation failure. Every schema under schemas/ is accounted for exactly once: either bound in entries (a config document) or listed in artifactSchemas (validates generated receipts, evidence and runtime artifacts, so no config document references it). An unclassified schema fails the check.",
